@@ -11,3 +11,21 @@ nearest euro cent. Quotes and bookings MUST both show the reduced total.
 #### Scenario: Two-day rental
 - WHEN a board at 2550 cents per day is quoted or booked for 2 days
 - THEN the total is 5100 cents, with no discount
+
+## Requirement: Hourly rental
+An item added with an hourly price SHALL be rentable by the hour: a rental shorter than a day that starts
+and ends on the hour MUST cost the hourly price for each hour, with no long-rental discount. An item
+without an hourly price MUST NOT be rented for less than a day. Rentals of a day or more still start and
+end at midnight UTC. Quotes and bookings MUST both show the hourly total.
+
+#### Scenario: Three-hour rental
+- WHEN a board at 700 cents per hour is quoted or booked from 13:00 to 16:00 on the same day
+- THEN the total is 2100 cents
+
+#### Scenario: No hourly price
+- WHEN a board without an hourly price is quoted or booked for less than a day
+- THEN the request is rejected
+
+#### Scenario: Not on the hour
+- WHEN an hourly rental starts or ends at 13:30
+- THEN the request is rejected
